A figure sitting in deep meditation, their form gradually dissolving and merging with a vast cosmic nebula, stardust particles streaming from their silhouette and connecting to countless other translucent human forms floating in the swirling galaxy around them. The scene rendered in Vincent van Gogh's distinctive post-impressionist style with bold, expressive brushstrokes creating dynamic spiraling patterns in deep blues, luminous yellows, and shimmering golds. The central figure transitions from solid earthly tones at the base to ethereal cosmic swirls at the top, their boundaries becoming indistinguishable from the starfield. Multiple interconnected luminous threads weave between all the floating figures, suggesting universal connection. The composition radiates outward from the meditating form like ripples in water, with characteristic thick impasto texture and rhythmic curved lines throughout the celestial backdrop.
